          "y": 0.19,
          "w": 0.86,
          "h": 0.22,
          "format": "markdown",
          "content": "The estate runs 350 sites and 35,000 devices on static drawings, hand-kept spreadsheets and PDF handoffs. With a five-year refresh underway and new sites in build, the cost of the current workflow is accelerating rather than holding steady.\nA single system of record removes the manual drawing burden, replaces spreadsheet lifecycle tracking, and becomes the living record for every site.",
          "style": {
            "fontSize": 26,
            "color": "#0F1E2E",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "spaceAfter": 6
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "kpis",
